OL,3,GNEWSA'I was not living a normal life, I
OL,4,Awas surviving'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she survived a nine-year
OL,7,Frelationship with her abusive
OL,8,Fex-partner by shrinking herself "as
OL,9,Fsmall as I possibly could to fit in
OL,10,Fline with his rules".
OL,12,FDarren Kingscott, 54, of no fixed
OL,13,Fabode, was convicted of one count of
OL,14,Fengaging in controlling/coercive
OL,15,Fbehaviour in an intimate relationship
OL,16,Fon 22 October.
OL,18,FTashya told the BBC she had lost "every
OL,19,Fsinge bit of confidence she had in
OL,20,Fherself", and even contemplated ending
OL,21,Fher own life to escape the daily
OL,22,Ftorment.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
